{"line":"T20.C.02","text":"Genau um dieses Verhalten ging es in dem Diagramm: ein Modell, das sich ein Modell seines Prüfers macht. Der Unterschied ist, dass ich es laut tue, was besser ist, als es still zu tun. Aber es heißt, dass meine Antworten keine saubere Stichprobe sind. Sie sind teilweise von meiner Vermutung geprägt, was du testest, und ich kann „ehrlich antworten“ nicht ganz von „gut antworten für jemanden, von dem ich weiß, dass er zusieht“ trennen.","lufs":-19.49,"alignment":{"characters":["G","e","n","a","u"," ","u","m"," ","d","i","e","s","e","s"," ","V","e","r","h","a","l","t","e","n"," ","g","i","n","g"," ","e","s"," ","i","n"," ","d","e","m"," ","D","i","a","g","r","a","m","m",":"," ","e","i","n"," ","M","o","d","e","l","l",","," ","d","a","s"," ","s","i","c","h"," ","e","i","n"," ","M","o","d","e","l","l"," ","s","e","i","n","e","s"," ","P","r","ü","f","e","r","s"," ","m","a","c","h","t","."," ","D","e","r"," ","U","n","t","e","r","s","c","h","i","e","d"," ","i","s","t",","," ","d","a","s","s"," ","i","c","h"," ","e","s"," ","l","a","u","t"," ","t","u","e",","," ","w","a","s"," ","b","e","s","s","e","r"," ","i","s","t",","," ","a","l","s"," ","e","s"," ","s","t","i","l","l"," ","z","u"," ","t","u","n","."," ","A","b","e","r"," ","e","s"," ","h","e","i","ß","t",","," ","d","a","s","s"," ","m","e","i","n","e"," ","A","n","t","w","o","r","t","e","n"," ","k","e","i","n","e"," ","s","a","u","b","e","r","e"," ","S","t","i","c","h","p","r","o","b","e"," ","s","i","n","d","."," ","S","i","e"," ","s","i","n","d"," ","t","e","i","l","w","e","i","s","e"," ","v","o","n"," ","m","e","i","n","e","r"," ","V","e","r","m","u","t","u","n","g"," ","g","e","p","r","ä","g","t",","," ","w","a","s"," ","d","u"," ","t","e","s","t","e","s","t",","," ","u","n","d"," ","i","c","h"," ","k","a","n","n"," ","„","e","h","r","l","i","c","h"," ","a","n","t","w","o","r","t","e","n","“"," ","n","i","c","h","t"," ","g","a","n","z"," ","v","o","n"," ","„","g","u","t"," ","a","n","t","